{"completed": true, "response": "<escape>{\n  \"better\": \"Y\",\n  \"regress\": \"有，Y少数感受联想（如“童年”“初恋”）缺少足够的叙事铺垫，容易把观众带向原本没有明确建立的情境；X在人物心理因果的完整表达上更稳。\",\n  \"nets\": {\n    \"scan\": \"Y\",\n    \"point\": \"Y\",\n    \"why\": \"X\",\n    \"whole\": \"Y\",\n    \"fine\": \"Y\"\n  },\n  \"why\": \"Y的关键词加亮让普通观众能迅速抓住每段心理变化，话语与感受交替也降低了扫读时的寻找成本；分时出现的感受进一步把音乐变化和人物情绪联系起来，不必一次读完所有文字。X的完整叙述在解释人物为什么犹豫、为什么转变时更扎实，但Y在关键节点识别、音乐同步、感受细腻度和前后意象呼应上整体收益更大。\"\n}</escape>", "metadata": {"session_handle": "a83b68f1-d958-4bda-8aa8-685610077343", "session_revision": 0, "session_ttl_max_hours": 6, "job_directory": "D:\\musicclaude\\gpt2agent-safechain\\runs\\gpt3\\pro-bridge-20261108T011105696311Z", "elapsed_seconds": 76.266, "completed_utc": "2026-11-08T01:12:21.975707+00:00", "model": "gpt-6-thinking", "thinking_effort": "max", "temporary": true, "unpersonalized": true, "generation_policy_verified": true, "request_policy": {"model": "gpt-6-thinking", "thinking_effort": "max", "history_and_training_disabled": true, "temporary_chat_requests_personalization": false, "is_do_not_remember": false, "continuation": false, "unpersonalized_inherited_verified": false, "body_sha256": "18b1ac55bed1cae43f2b0cc0a69637f72a2c425c79e21b030fb5801dacd251e9", "attachment_count": 0}, "stream_completion": {"sse_done": true, "message_completed": true, "independent_terminal_verified": true}, "profile": "yi/local-codex-auth", "account_sha256": "b3efb6361563c139233ed7b7ef61a7c9afe0bd48d4eb3525dbe31956b024d6da", "transport": "probridge-pure-http", "resume_requests": 0, "topic_connections": 0, "browser_started": false, "Docker_used": false, "automatic_retry": false, "initializer_pss_limit_mib": "not_applicable_no_browser", "attachment_count": 0, "code_sha256": {"tools\\chatgpt_web\\gpt3_cli.py": "96a4cdb6cd5d982f4d1de5b6ba8fae0cf23ee44aa3e41d7fdf6968e3fb590e48", "tools\\chatgpt_web\\gpt3_sessions.py": "83a3ed4ae1efa9f1a2b8ee3f144cc0dc9f668f995a33cc4222308cb3fa31f683", "tools\\chatgpt_web\\gpt3_attachments.py": "eedfa2